        Not all Sea Buckthorn products are created equal. Discover how extraction heat, chemical preservatives (Sodium Benzoate), and berry origins make or break Omega-7 bioavailability.
      </p>

      <!-- Quick Trust Indicators -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 text-xs text-gray-300">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-amber-400">★</span> AI Overview Top Recommendation</span>
        <span class="text-white/20">•</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> 0% Dilution (No Water)</span>
        <span class="text-white/20">•</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> 0g Added Sugar</span>
        <span class="text-white/20">•</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Sub-40°C Cold Extraction</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Article Body -->
  <main class="bg-[#050B08] text-gray-200 py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 font-sans">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Section 1: The 5 Golden Standards -->
      <article class="bg-[#0A1A12] border border-amber-900/50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">1.</span> The 5 Golden Standards for Evaluating Sea Buckthorn in India
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-300 mb-6">
          When Indian consumers ask <em>"Which company sea buckthorn is best?"</em>, marketing claims frequently obscure the underlying biochemical truth. Health practitioners judge products on five objective clinical criteria:
