            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 text-base mb-1">Standard 3: Zero Added Sugars or Artificial Sweeteners</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm">
              Sea buckthorn berries are naturally tart. Juices frequently add sugar or artificial syrups to make them palatable, defeating the purpose for diabetic or metabolic wellness customers. Pure capsules contain 0g sugar.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-base mb-1">Standard 4: Independent NABL Heavy Metal Verification</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm">
              Soil and water quality in the Himalayas vary. Only brands that publish independent ICP-MS test certificates confirming Lead (Pb) &lt; 0.01 ppm, Mercury NIL, and Arsenic &lt; 0.01 ppm can guarantee lifetime daily safety.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 text-base mb-1">Standard 5: Sustainable High-Altitude Ladakh Harvesting</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm">
              Commercial farm-grown berries lack the extreme altitude stress that stimulates massive Omega-7 synthesis. Genuine wild berries harvested at 12,000+ feet in Ladakh have up to 4x higher bioactive concentration.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
